{"id":"n64562-1-23","stage":1,"title":"대화 · 聊天","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64562-1-23-1","ko":"자, 같이 경찰서로 가요!","zh":"来，我们一起去警察局吧！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자,","meaning":"那","explanation":"자：那。","readings":[{"term":"자","audio":"/audio/34f404d9d0a79aa558ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25945","senseId":"1","lemma":"자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자","audio":"/audio/34f404d9d0a79aa558ba.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一起，一同","explanation":"같이：一起，一同。","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"1","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"경찰서로","meaning":"警察署，警察局，公安局","explanation":"경찰서：警察署，警察局，公安局；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"경찰서","audio":"/audio/d7c352449c7960ec1ec2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25960","senseId":"1","lemma":"경찰서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경찰서로","audio":"/audio/d48f109748dee80ab41a.mp3"}},{"text":"가요!","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가요","audio":"/audio/f56d0f13cacc6a44dd26.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"34f404d9d0a79aa5","term":"자","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/34f404d9d0a79aa558ba.mp3","entryId":"25945","definition":"用于劝说或催促别人做某事。","pronunciation":["자"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一起，一同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"两个以上同时。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"d7c352449c7960ec","term":"경찰서","zh":"警察署，警察局，公安局","audio":"/audio/d7c352449c7960ec1ec2.mp3","entryId":"25960","definition":"负责一个地区的公安工作的官厅。","pronunciation":["경ː찰써"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"